## Chosen and merged by an order

capability order/smallest-n  the n smallest elements by an order, the smallest first
  heroes  lists.min_n_by
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  heapq.nsmallest
  note    stable as Python's: of equal elements the earlier first, observed on cards of repeated rank for n from 0 to past the length. A count below zero aborts, as `lists.take` does, where Python answers an empty list. 10 of 1,000,000 measured at 0.04 s

capability order/largest-n  the n largest elements by an order, the largest first
  heroes  lists.max_n_by
